{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":20042,"name":null,"username":"TalkAdmin","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/dec6dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2025-08-13T19:59:38.338Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eEffective Date: August 13, 2025\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: v0.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/t/nervos-talk-v0-1/8907\"\u003e中文版\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-20042-chapter-1-general-principles-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-20042-chapter-1-general-principles-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChapter 1: General Principles\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArticle 1: Purpose\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNervos Talk is the public discussion space for the Nervos community and one of the primary venues for Nervos builders to discuss, communicate, and collaborate to advance the Nervos ecosystem. Excellent public discourse can only thrive in a rational, inclusive, and friendly environment. This requires all participants to adhere to basic rules of conduct and to cherish and maintain this public space for the Nervos community. To foster a healthy, rational, and inclusive forum environment, these guidelines have been established.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArticle 2: Basic Principles\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDiscussions should be based on facts and logic.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePurely price-related and speculative market discussions are not permitted.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRespect diverse viewpoints and prohibit personal attacks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEncourage content and behavior that contribute to the ecosystem’s growth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe forum governance process shall be open and transparent.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-20042-chapter-2-user-conduct-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-20042-chapter-2-user-conduct-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChapter 2: User Conduct\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArticle 3: Encouraged Behavior\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe encourage all activities that contribute to the healthy development of the Nervos ecosystem, including but not limited to:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Contributions:\u003c/strong\u003e Sharing original technical tutorials, development experience, and reporting bugs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommunity Building:\u003c/strong\u003e Welcoming new members, organizing events, and translating high-quality content.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Growth:\u003c/strong\u003e Promoting Nervos use cases, participating in proposal discussions, and writing project analyses.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArticle 4: Violations and Actions\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo maintain forum order, moderators will take corresponding actions against the following behaviors. Repeated violations will lead to escalated actions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMinor Violations\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBehavior:\u003c/strong\u003e Off-topic posting, repetitive content, engaging in purely price-related speculation or trading discussions, inflammatory language, spamming, spreading unverified rumors, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAction:\u003c/strong\u003e The moderator will remove the relevant content and issue a warning.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModerate Violations\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBehavior:\u003c/strong\u003e Maliciously spreading FUD, personal attacks or insults, intentionally inciting conflict between community projects, abusing the report function, deliberate misinformation, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAction:\u003c/strong\u003e Depending on the severity, the moderator will issue a temporary ban of 1 to 4 weeks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSevere Violations\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBehavior:\u003c/strong\u003e Posting illegal content, market manipulation speech, doxxing or leaking private information, commercial fraud, hate speech or discriminatory remarks, malicious attacks on the community or its members, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAction:\u003c/strong\u003e Depending on the severity, the moderator will issue a ban of over 1 month, up to a permanent ban.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelevant actions taken by moderators will be publicly logged in a designated thread.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-20042-chapter-3-forum-administration-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-20042-chapter-3-forum-administration-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChapter 3: Forum Administration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArticle 5: Moderators\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelection Mechanism:\u003c/strong\u003e Moderators are central to maintaining forum order. Initially, the Nervos Foundation will invite 2 senior members from both the Chinese and English-speaking communities to serve as moderators.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFuture Development:\u003c/strong\u003e In the future, we will open channels for community self-nomination and election, allowing more dedicated and responsible members to participate in forum administration.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsibilities:\u003c/strong\u003e Moderators are responsible for enforcing these guidelines and maintaining a healthy discussion atmosphere. All moderation actions will strive to be fair, just, and transparent.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eLet’s build Nervos Talk into a high-quality public space through our valuable contributions and positive actions, and jointly advance the Nervos ecosystem.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThese guidelines are a trial version. We welcome all community members to provide suggestions for improving the governance of the Nervos Talk forum.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-28T00:56:19.898Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":23,"reads":91,"readers_count":90,"score":373.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":8906,"topic_slug":"nervos-talk-governance-guidelines-v0-1","display_username":null,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://talk.nervos.org/t/nervos-talk-v0-1/8907","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Nervos Talk 管理规则 v0.1","clicks":10}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":8}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":3781,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/nervos-talk-governance-guidelines-v0-1/8906/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":8}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":8,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_un